Provider Selection > Spot Price and Options Chain: selected provider
Spot Price and Options Chain > Background Refresh Services: options chain + spot
Background Refresh Services > GEX and Greeks Calculation: filtered contracts
GEX and Greeks Calculation > Hawkes and Kalman Enrichment: GEX snapshot
Hawkes and Kalman Enrichment > In-Memory TTL Cache: fresh live snapshot
Hawkes and Kalman Enrichment > Historical Persistence and Replay Service: persist eligible snapshot

Historical Persistence and Replay Service > PostgreSQL 18
PostgreSQL 18 > Market Sessions, GEX Snapshots and Strike Breakdown, Raw Options Snapshots and IV Surface

Frontend Initial Load > FastAPI REST Endpoints: REST requests
FastAPI REST Endpoints > In-Memory TTL Cache: check cache
FastAPI REST Endpoints > Analytics and Backtesting Engines: analytics or backtest requests
Analytics and Backtesting Engines > Historical Persistence and Replay Service: historical and replay queries
Analytics and Backtesting Engines > Analytics and Backtest Pages: summary, IV, technical, backtest payloads

In-Memory TTL Cache > WebSocket Stream: live snapshot
WebSocket Stream > WebSocket Hook: gex_update
WebSocket Hook > React Query Cache Sync: sync latest snapshot
React Query Cache Sync > Dashboard Components
In-Memory TTL Cache > Dashboard Components: current, strikes, and market payloads

FastAPI REST Endpoints --> Live Fetch on Cache Miss: cache miss [color: orange]
Live Fetch on Cache Miss --> Provider Selection [color: orange]
Live Fetch on Cache Miss --> GEX and Greeks Calculation [color: orange]

FastAPI REST Endpoints --> Persisted Replay or Demo Fallback: provider unavailable or low-quality snapshot [color: orange]
PostgreSQL 18 --> Persisted Replay or Demo Fallback: replay-eligible session data [color: orange]
Persisted Replay or Demo Fallback --> Dashboard Components: persisted or demo response [color: orange]

WebSocket Hook --> REST Polling Fallback: stream unavailable [color: orange]
REST Polling Fallback --> FastAPI REST Endpoints: REST fallback [color: orange]
Analytics and Backtesting Engines --> Provider Selection: provider-backed indicator fetches when needed [color: orange]
